rooms_desc ({"You have just entered Mirage's home.  This room is a small room with a closet and a table.  The closet is on you right and is a place for Mirage'sguests to hang there coats.  There is a small table on the left with a vase offlowers and a dish of mints.  The room is very bright and cheery.  To the north you see the room where Mirage entertains his guest.","The room is a large room with beautiful oak walls and plush carpeting.The first thing you notice when entering is the couch and loveseat thatlook very comfortable.  Across from the couch is a huge entertainmentcenter with a large-screen tv, a vcr, and a great stereo system.  To the right of the couch, you see a fireplace with a fire burning in it.  You also notice a comfortable bench for 2 next to the fireplace.  Above the fireplace is a mantle with a beautiful picture on it.  The whole feeling of the room is very warm and cozy.  To the south, you see the enterance to the house, to the east you see a jacuzzi tub, and to the north you seea playroom with arcade games and work-out equipment.","You have just entered another room in Mirage's house and the first thing you notice is a nice, big jacuzzi tub in the middle of the room.  The roomis very warm and humid because of the jacuzzi tub but yet everyone seems to like this room the best.  To the right is a changeing room where peoplego to get out of there clothes and get into something more appropriate for the jacuzzi.  That can be anything you want.  Mirage likes to come to this room a hard day of fighting or when he is with that special woman in his life.  To the west you see the room where Mirage entertains his guests and tothe east you see Mirage's bedroom.","You have just entered Mirage's bedroom.  This is the most spectacular of allthe rooms in Mirage's home.  The room is quite large and is done in as oak-wood and dark green scheme.  The floor is carpeted with very plush carpeting.To the left you see Mirage's bed.  The queen-sized bed has a thick, warmcomforter on it with dark-green satin sheets.  On the night table next to the bed is a large picture.  Straight ahead of you, you see a big fireplace.There is a fire burning and makes the room feel very cozy.  To the rightyou see a wall of glass with beautiful french doors in the middle.  Throughthe wall of glass you see a large deck and a giant waterfall.  The sound given off by the waterfall is very soothing and relaxing.  The deck looks tobe a nice place to go to eat a meal or just relax and enjoy natures beauty.Outside is very secluded so that you don't have to worry about anyone bothering you.  To the west you see the jacuzzi room and to the south is the beatiful deck.","You have just entered onto Mirage's deck.  The deck is stunningly beautiful.It is made out of western red cedar, has a cedar handrail all around, andjust takes your breath away.  After noticeing the deck itself, you look to the south and notice the most incredible waterfall you have ever seen.  The wateris crystal clear and the sound of the water falling is the most peaceful you have ever felt.  Looking around you notice woods that block anyone from evergetting in.  You are quite secluded and can do what ever you like.  You alsonotice many different bird feeders near the deck that attract all types of birds including hummingbirds, sparrows, robbins, bluejays, and many others.Looking around on the deck you notice many comfortable chairs and a rather large picnic table.  You also see a large bar-b-que.  This is definatelya great place for Mirage to have guests or to come just to relax.  Often   times Mirage will eat meals outside here on the deck to be able to enjoy nature as it was meant to be.  To the north is Mirage's bedroom and to the westis Mirage's Kitchen.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"This is the enterance to Mirage's house.","This is the room where Mirage entertains his guests.","This is Mirage's jacuzzi room.","This is Mirage's bedroom.","This is an outside deck where you can come to enjoy nature.","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",0,0,0,})
