items ({({"flowers","You see a mixture of roses.  The scent of the flowers takes your breath away.",}),({"tv","You see Mirage's favorite show: Late Night with David Letterman","fireplace","You see a warm, crackling fire.  It is very romantic.","picture","You see a beautiful picture of Mercy and Mirage.",}),0,({"picture","You see a beautiful picture of Mirage's wife Mercy.","fireplace","The sound of the crackling wood sets a very romantic mood for the room.","bed]","1","bed","You see a very comfortable looking bed with tons of pillows.","windows","You notice some of the windows are open which let the sound waterfall come in.",}),({"chairs","You see many comfortable chairs.  Sit down and enjoy the sights",}),0,0,0,0,0,})
